    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775810/extras/feaa1fcb3751d98607374a9b5f986574.avif?t=1749528777\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world of mystery, where nobility and damnation meet, emerges <strong>Vampire Suika Girls - Helsing</strong> \u2013 a game blending cunning strategy, dark mysticism, and an insatiable thirst!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you <strong>summon and manipulate energies</strong> to create mystical chain reactions, unleashing devastating blows against your rivals! But here, each &quot;ritual&quot; isn't just damage \u2013 it's a <strong>draining of their sanity and vitality!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay Mechanics:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unleash Shadow Orbs:</strong> Launch orbs of arcane energy into the arena and combine them to form larger, more potent concentrations of your supernatural influence!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Break Their Will:</strong> Accumulate sequences to shatter your opponents' mental defenses! The more intense the sequence, the more &quot;vulnerable&quot; and exposed they become to your will...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forbidden Powers:</strong> Ancient knowledge and cursed relics can turn the tide of the confrontation \u2013 will you achieve supremacy before the night consumes you?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775810/extras/661c2db0c942e2633e425f4a3565ae82.avif?t=1749528777\" data-has-big width=800 height=648 /></span></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775810/extras/feaa1fcb3751d98607374a9b5f986574.avif?t=1749528777\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world of mystery, where nobility and damnation meet, emerges <strong>Vampire Suika Girls - Helsing</strong> \u2013 a game blending cunning strategy, dark mysticism, and an insatiable thirst!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you <strong>summon and manipulate energies</strong> to create mystical chain reactions, unleashing devastating blows against your rivals! But here, each &quot;ritual&quot; isn't just damage \u2013 it's a <strong>draining of their sanity and vitality!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay Mechanics:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unleash Shadow Orbs:</strong> Launch orbs of arcane energy into the arena and combine them to form larger, more potent concentrations of your supernatural influence!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Break Their Will:</strong> Accumulate sequences to shatter your opponents' mental defenses! The more intense the sequence, the more &quot;vulnerable&quot; and exposed they become to your will...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forbidden Powers:</strong> Ancient knowledge and cursed relics can turn the tide of the confrontation \u2013 will you achieve supremacy before the night consumes you?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775810/extras/661c2db0c942e2633e425f4a3565ae82.avif?t=1749528777\" data-has-big width=800 height=648 /></span></p></li></ul>",
